<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Saraiva started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Saraiva started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BB Securities said it had started coverage of Brazilian book publisher and retailer Saraiva SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The exceptionally high financial returns, despite a degree of historic underperformance in the bookstore division, combines with aggressive growth prospects to provide an excellent investment opportunity,&quot; BB Securities said in a June 18 report.</p>
<p>-- Preferred shares in the company closed Wednesday at 7.30 reais.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
